    "introduction": "F&C Investment Trust holds a diversified portfolio of global investments, giving shareholders access to many companies through a single listed vehicle. Its portfolio includes public equities and exposure to private equity, spreading investments across markets and business sectors. Returns come from dividends and changes in the value of underlying holdings, after management costs and other expenses. The trust structure allows its shares to trade independently of the portfolio's net asset value, creating a premium or discount. Its broad approach differs from a company selling products or services: performance primarily reflects investment selection, market movements, currency exposure and the way portfolio capital is allocated over time.",
